Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-001193
01:42:09.780 --> 01:42:11.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa definition po natin ng

asr-001194
01:42:11.780 --> 01:42:13.780
