Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ang LGSF,

asr-001445
02:02:23.840 --> 02:02:34.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ang released ay 59.74%, ang obligated po ay 13.01%, at ang disbursed po ay 4.15%.

asr-001446
02:02:34.660 --> 02:02:48.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sa 2026 po, as of July 22, ang released po ay 82.73%, obligated ay 20.2%, at yung disbursement po ay 43.1%.

asr-001447
02:02:48.120 --> 02:02:50.760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po ang ano? 2026, ano po ang utilization rate?

asr-001448
02:02:50.760 --> 02:02:51.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May...

asr-001449
02:02:51.760 --> 02:02:53.760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Anong gamitin natin?

asr-001450
02:02:53.840 --> 02:03:03.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ang basehan na lang po natin, Madam Speaker, yung released amount.

asr-001451
02:03:03.480 --> 02:03:12.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So sa 2025 po, 59.74% out of the 18.95 billion pesos na allocation.

asr-001452
02:03:13.160 --> 02:03:20.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At sa 2026 po, 82.73% out of the 37.49 billion allocation.

asr-001453
02:03:20.060 --> 02:03:23.060
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ibig pong sabihin yung utilization ng 2026.

asr-001454
02:03:23.840 --> 02:03:27.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ibig pong sabihin yung utilization ng 2026 ay mas mataas kaysa sa 2025.

asr-001455
02:03:27.380 --> 02:03:28.000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Tama po ba yan?

asr-001456
02:03:28.300 --> 02:03:30.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: 82% ang utilization.

asr-001457
02:03:52.150 --> 02:03:52.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po yan.

asr-001460
02:03:53.160 --> 02:03:59.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ang base po sa datos ng DBM, mas mataas po yung utilization rate ng 2026 ng LGSF

asr-001461
02:03:59.440 --> 02:04:01.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kumpara po sa 2025 ng LGSF.

asr-001462
02:04:01.640 --> 02:04:04.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ang kadahilanan po ay yung LGSF price.

asr-001463
02:04:05.220 --> 02:04:07.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yun po yung mataas yung utilization rate.

asr-001464
02:04:07.820 --> 02:04:11.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron po siya sa 2026, pero wala po siya sa 2025.

asr-001465
02:04:13.120 --> 02:04:19.280
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ibig pong sabihin, mas madaling na nagamit yung pondo ng 2026.

asr-001466
02:04:20.000 --> 02:04:22.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Bakit po kaya madaling na gamit yung price?

asr-001467
02:04:22.400 --> 02:04:22.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Bakit po kaya madaling na gamit yung price?

asr-001468
02:04:23.160 --> 02:04:25.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Binamigay na lang lahat sa lahat yung rice.

asr-001469
02:04:27.220 --> 02:04:35.920
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po ang development economic impact nung pagbibigay ng bigas ng kanyang kalalaki?

asr-001470
02:04:44.720 --> 02:04:50.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mabilis po kasi yung distribution ng rice kasi po lahat po ng mga LGUs sa buong bansa nabigyan po.

asr-001471
02:04:50.940 --> 02:04:52.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So mas mabilis po siya kumpara sa halimbawa.

asr-001472
02:04:53.160 --> 02:04:58.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Halimbawa yung individual projects na rinirequest po ng LGU doon sa portal.

asr-001473
02:04:58.520 --> 02:05:07.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung dahilan po kung bakit ipinamigay po yung bigas ay bilang pagresponde po doon sa iba't ibang mga krisis.

asr-001474
02:05:08.060 --> 02:05:16.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Halimbawa po yung pagtaas po ng presyo ng crudo, ng koryente, at yung mga nawalan din po ng trabaho.

asr-001475
02:05:17.020 --> 02:05:18.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kaya kailangan po matugunan din po kagad.

asr-001476
02:05:18.800 --> 02:05:20.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Talagang ayuda rin po ito.

asr-001477
02:05:22.040 --> 02:05:22.920
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ayuda to, di ba?

asr-001478
02:05:24.020 --> 02:05:25.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Walang economic impact to eh.

asr-001479
02:05:25.480 --> 02:05:27.860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kundi pagbibigay ng bigas, limang kilo, sampung kilo.

asr-001480
02:05:30.960 --> 02:05:32.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi ba ito patronage politics?

asr-001481
02:05:36.460 --> 02:05:46.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There is an economic factor din po which is where we are endeavoring po na hindi po bumagsak sa below poverty line.

asr-001482
02:05:46.360 --> 02:05:52.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung mga pamilya na pinaka-vulnerable po dito po sa mga ganitong external shock.

asr-001483
02:05:53.160 --> 02:06:03.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So there's also a multiplier effect in the sense that yung mga bigas po ay kinukuha sa mga local farmers.

asr-001484
02:06:03.780 --> 02:06:10.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So meron po din guaranteed na bumibili noong bigas, yung mga palay, yung mga produkto na ating mga magsasaka.

asr-001485
02:06:10.640 --> 02:06:16.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So meron din po siyang economic, may economic ecosystem din po.

asr-001486
02:06:17.240 --> 02:06:22.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Namomonitor po ba ng PBM yung pagbibigay ng bigas?

asr-001487
02:06:23.160 --> 02:06:31.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ang DILG po, ang nag-incharge po ng monitoring ng distribution ng LGS price.

asr-001488
02:06:31.780 --> 02:06:34.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Bibigyan ko po kayo ng isang example sa Kaloocan.

asr-001489
02:06:35.260 --> 02:06:37.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung isang banko, Philippine Business Bank.

asr-001490
02:06:37.660 --> 02:06:44.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Lahat na empleyado, from manager to ordinary employee, tigko 40 kilos na bigas.

asr-001491
02:06:46.780 --> 02:06:47.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: 40 kilos.

asr-001492
02:06:48.460 --> 02:06:50.500
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So exclusively at the discretion.

asr-001493
02:06:53.160 --> 02:06:59.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Paano nakakatulong ito sa mga mahirap kung ang binibigyan mo ang mga executive ng banko?

asr-001494
02:07:04.500 --> 02:07:14.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, given that the DILG is in charge of the monitoring, yun po dapat yung mga bagay na huhuli ng DILG.

asr-001495
02:07:15.040 --> 02:07:21.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So kung may mga ganito pong pagkakataon, dapat po ma-report po sa DILG para po matugunan nila.

asr-001496
02:07:22.400 --> 02:07:23.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So meron po ba?

asr-001497
02:07:23.160 --> 02:07:29.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ito ang assessment na nagawa ang PBM sa utilization ng 2025 at least.

asr-001498
02:07:30.060 --> 02:07:31.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: 2025 LGSF.

asr-001499
02:07:32.560 --> 02:07:34.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: And can you furnish us a copy?

asr-001500
02:07:34.460 --> 02:07:34.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Thank you.

asr-001501
02:07:53.160 --> 02:08:11.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, may I ask po our distinguished colleague, what sort of report po would you like for the 2025 utilization?

asr-001502
02:08:11.020 --> 02:08:11.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: How it was distributed?

asr-001503
02:08:12.600 --> 02:08:13.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: How it was distributed?

asr-001504
02:08:13.940 --> 02:08:16.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: In terms of which LGUs po?

asr-001506
02:08:17.040 --> 02:08:19.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Are the recipients the types of projects?

asr-001507
02:08:19.920 --> 02:08:20.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yes.

asr-001508
02:08:20.140 --> 02:08:20.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Apo.

asr-001509
02:08:20.560 --> 02:08:23.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sa kasalukuyan po, yung...

asr-001510
02:08:23.160 --> 02:08:35.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So far po, yung roughly 52% na na-dispersed po for 2025, lahat po ng datos doon po sa releases, nandun na rin po, naka-upload na po sa Compass portal ng DBM.

asr-001511
02:08:35.460 --> 02:08:36.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pero magbibigay din po.

asr-001512
02:08:36.640 --> 02:08:42.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang nakalagay po doon yung amount of releases o yung goods that were given?

asr-001513
02:08:45.300 --> 02:08:50.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Nandito po sa Compass, actually po, nakita ko po ngayon ang ganda po ng dashboard nila.

asr-001514
02:08:51.180 --> 02:08:52.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And nandun po yung...

asr-001515
02:08:53.160 --> 02:09:00.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Bawat proyekto at bawat LGU at magkano at kung anong klaseng proyekto po.

asr-001516
02:09:00.560 --> 02:09:14.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Halimbawa po, NCR, Metro Manila, Manila, Multipurpose Building, Construction of Pamantasan ng Lungsod na Maynila, College of Allied Health Sciences, 500 million, year 2025 po.

asr-001517
02:09:15.040 --> 02:09:17.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So pwede nating ma-filter po yun doon po sa Compass website.

asr-001518
02:09:18.180 --> 02:09:22.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sa apalagay niyo po, Madam Chair, equitable po ang distribution nito?

asr-001519
02:09:23.160 --> 02:09:23.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Equitable.

asr-001520
02:09:36.540 --> 02:09:43.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For 2026 po, Madam Speaker, equitable po dahil po lahat binigyan.

asr-001521
02:09:44.300 --> 02:09:48.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung 2025 po, nakabatay po kasi sa kung sino yung nag-request.

asr-001522
02:09:48.240 --> 02:09:53.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So posible po na may ibang mga LGU, may ibang mga probinsya.

asr-001523
02:09:53.160 --> 02:09:56.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Na hindi po nag-request. So wala po silang natanggap.

asr-001524
02:09:56.880 --> 02:10:02.820
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So sa 2027 po, paano po i-dedistribute ito?

asr-001525
02:10:16.420 --> 02:10:23.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Para po sa taong 2027, dahil po yung panukalang amount po ng LGU,

asr-001526
02:10:23.140 --> 02:10:27.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: GSF ay parehas doon sa 2026 ga.

asr-001527
02:10:27.720 --> 02:10:32.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ang intensyon po ayon sa DBM ay pareho pa rin po yung distribution.

asr-001528
02:10:32.560 --> 02:10:37.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So with regard to rice, lahat pa rin po na local government units mabibigyan.

asr-001529
02:10:37.700 --> 02:10:46.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And with regard to infrastructure po, it would still depend on whether there's an LGU that requested from a particular area.

asr-001530
02:10:46.160 --> 02:10:52.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And it would still be consistent po with the same menu and criteria that we approve.

asr-001531
02:10:52.220 --> 02:10:57.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So in the 2027 ga, under the special provision for LGSF.

asr-001532
02:10:57.060 --> 02:10:59.480
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of our good mentor.

asr-001533
02:10:59.480 --> 02:11:00.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Last question, ma'am. Thank you.

asr-001534
02:11:04.200 --> 02:11:11.860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kaya po ako nagtatanong, sapagkat napakamahalaga po na masinop yung paggamit natin ng 7.2 trillion.

asr-001535
02:11:13.000 --> 02:11:21.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sapagkat sa 17.2 trillion, ang projected government revenue ay 5.2 trillion lamang. Tama po?

asr-001536
02:11:22.220 --> 02:11:24.860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At yun ay projected pa lang.

asr-001537
02:11:26.420 --> 02:11:29.620
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sa bagsak nating GDP, baka hindi pa ma-realize.

asr-001538
02:11:31.060 --> 02:11:36.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pagkatapos po, ang uutangin natin para ponduhan nito ay 1.69 trillion.

asr-001539
02:11:38.620 --> 02:11:46.640
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sa 1.69 trillion po, for development projects, kasama na yung mga ayuda, 1.1 trillion.

asr-001540
02:11:46.640 --> 02:11:52.060
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ibig sabihin, yung napuponduhan ng pagutang natin, pati yung personal services,

asr-001541
02:11:52.220 --> 02:11:55.080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: pati yung MOOE. Kaya po mahalaga.

asr-001542
02:11:56.280 --> 02:12:07.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At pagkatapos po, kailangan pa nating mangutang muli ng 3.3 trillion para bayaran yung mga nag-mature na utang natin.

asr-001543
02:12:07.780 --> 02:12:08.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Tama po ba yan?

asr-001544
02:12:10.420 --> 02:12:18.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Aside from the 1.69 trillion na uutangin para ponduhan ng 2027 national budget,

asr-001545
02:12:18.780 --> 02:12:21.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: mangungutang na naman tayo ng 3.3.

asr-001546
02:12:22.220 --> 02:12:27.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: 3.3 trillion para bayaran yung mga maturing na utang.

asr-001547
02:12:28.040 --> 02:12:28.880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Tama po ba yan?

asr-001548
02:12:34.320 --> 02:12:44.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, if we may clarify po, the 3.3 trillion peso borrowing already includes the deficit of 1.69.

asr-001549
02:12:44.800 --> 02:12:49.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, kabuuan na po na borrowing po natin yung 3.3 trillion.

asr-001550
02:12:50.340 --> 02:12:51.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kasama na po yung deficit.

asr-001551
02:12:51.620 --> 02:12:53.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tapos on top po yung iba pa.

asr-001552
02:12:55.280 --> 02:13:07.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, ibig sabihin po, ang 1.69 trillion yung utangin for the 2027 national budget. Tama po?

asr-001553
02:13:14.540 --> 02:13:15.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Opo, tama po yan.

asr-001554
02:13:15.780 --> 02:13:21.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: 1.694 trillion para po doon sa 2027 budget.

asr-001555
02:13:21.240 --> 02:13:22.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Para po mapondohan.

asr-001556
02:13:22.720 --> 02:13:25.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At yung remainder po ay...

asr-001557
02:13:25.020 --> 02:13:28.940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang 1.6 trillion ay yun naman yung pangbayad po.

asr-001558
02:13:29.960 --> 02:13:34.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pangbayad po is doon sa mga nag-mature na natin na mga utang.

asr-001559
02:13:36.280 --> 02:13:37.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, payment of maturities.

asr-001560
02:13:38.180 --> 02:13:39.220
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, utangin natin ulit yun.

asr-001561
02:13:39.460 --> 02:13:43.560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, ibig pong sabihin, next year, after 2027, lalaki na naman.

asr-001562
02:13:44.180 --> 02:13:46.920
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Mas langong lalaki yung ating interest payment.

asr-001563
02:13:47.160 --> 02:13:47.760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Tama po ba yan?

asr-001564
02:13:47.760 --> 02:13:49.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Tama po ba yan?

asr-001565
02:14:11.600 --> 02:14:16.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po, madam speaker. Last year po kasi, 0.996 trillion po yun po interest payments.

asr-001566
02:14:16.960 --> 02:14:20.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sa 2027 po, 1.114.

asr-001567
02:14:20.360 --> 02:14:21.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At sa 2027, 1.114.

asr-001569
02:14:22.500 --> 02:14:28.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At sa 2028, ang forecast po, although very preliminary, tataas din po kumpada sa 2027.

asr-001570
02:14:28.380 --> 02:14:37.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang ibig sabihin po ba dito ay lilit muli ang fiscal space for 2028?

asr-001571
02:14:42.300 --> 02:14:45.060
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of our good colleague.

asr-001572
02:14:45.500 --> 02:14:46.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Last question.

asr-001573
02:14:46.100 --> 02:14:49.100
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: You have an...

asr-001574
02:14:50.340 --> 02:14:51.100
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: You're...

asr-001575
02:14:51.220 --> 02:14:55.860
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: You have exceeded the 30-minute rule.

asr-001576
02:14:56.860 --> 02:14:59.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam speaker, if I may respond po.

asr-001577
02:14:59.140 --> 02:14:59.980
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Very quickly, please.

asr-001578
02:15:00.000 --> 02:15:15.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The last question. Sa kasalukuyan po, publicly available na rin po ang initial po na inaprobahan ng DBCC para po sa 2028 budget ay 7.2 trillion pesos pa rin po.

asr-001579
02:15:15.320 --> 02:15:32.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, preliminarily po, preliminarily, yun po yung naaprobahan ng DBCC. So, tama po na dahil tataas yung interest payment sa 2028 pero po mananatiling 7.2 trillion pesos yung kabuuan ng budget.

asr-001580
02:15:32.840 --> 02:15:38.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: In essence po, kinakain niya po yung ating fiscal space. So, ninipis po na konti yung fiscal space.

asr-001581
02:15:38.920 --> 02:15:39.880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001582
02:15:40.220 --> 02:15:43.000
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you very much, Congressman Erice. Majority Leader?

asr-001583
02:15:43.000 --> 02:15:45.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much po, Madam Speaker.

asr-001584
02:15:45.420 --> 02:15:47.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much po to the Honorable Ege Erice.

asr-001585
02:15:48.640 --> 02:15:54.440
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Robert Nazal of the BH Party List Interpolation.

asr-001586
02:15:54.440 --> 02:15:57.080
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Nazal is recognized for his interpolation.

asr-001587
02:16:03.820 --> 02:16:05.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001588
02:16:12.120 --> 02:16:15.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair, through you, to the DBM.

asr-001589
02:16:15.320 --> 02:16:24.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Your own 2026 NEP still contained the long-standing prohibition against impoundment of appropriations.

asr-001590
02:16:26.020 --> 02:16:42.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But in the enacted 2026 GAA, this was replaced by Section 78, suspension of expenditure, which allows the President to stop expenditure when public interest so requires.

asr-001591
02:16:42.160 --> 02:16:45.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: The same provision is again proposed.

asr-001592
02:16:45.320 --> 02:17:02.460
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, my question, Madam Chair, is Section 38 of the Administrative Code already gave the President authority to suspend expenditure when public interest so requires.

asr-001593
02:17:02.460 --> 02:17:15.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: If that authority already exists, why was it necessary to remove the long-standing prohibition against impoundment provision and replace it with this provision?

asr-001596
02:17:21.100 --> 02:17:22.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much po, Madam Chair.

asr-001597
02:17:22.180 --> 02:17:29.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, it is simply a reiteration of what is indicated in Section 38 of EO 292.

asr-001598
02:17:30.720 --> 02:17:34.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And actually po ginagawa rin naman po natin yun, hindi lang sa provision na to.

asr-001599
02:17:34.860 --> 02:17:42.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May iba din po mga special provisions and general provisions na simple reiteration ng po sila noong pong substantive law.

asr-001609
02:17:43.800 --> 02:17:45.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pero originally po

asr-001611
02:17:45.260 --> 02:17:46.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: for the last 20 years

asr-001612
02:17:46.820 --> 02:17:49.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: binabawal natin yung impounding

