Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And special purpose funds that have no details necessary for release. So yun po yung safeguard, General Provision No. 3 po.

asr-001817
02:35:03.440 --> 02:35:06.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Can you please

asr-001818
02:35:06.040 --> 02:35:17.500
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So there are specific conditions by which a particular allotment would not be released; otherwise the general rule is it should be released.

asr-001819
02:35:17.500 --> 02:35:21.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bakit po yung ano? Bakit po yung based doon sa NEP?

asr-001820
02:35:21.620 --> 02:35:24.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bakit po yung congressional initiatives

asr-001821
02:35:24.600 --> 02:35:24.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bakit po?

asr-001826
02:35:26.260 --> 02:35:40.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bakit po yung congressional initiatives, nirequire ng aficero tapos nag-require ng additional requirements?

asr-001827
02:35:42.020 --> 02:35:45.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Wala po yun sa binasa nyo, Madam Chair.

asr-001828
02:35:46.020 --> 02:35:50.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: In the case po, I wouldn't call them congressional initiatives.

asr-001829
02:35:50.140 --> 02:35:57.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Those are probably, with your permission po, we'll tag them as items that have deviations between the NEP and the GAA.

asr-001830
02:35:58.440 --> 02:36:03.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, yun po kasi, those are items that have not been vetted by the DBM.

asr-001831
02:36:04.520 --> 02:36:12.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It didn't go through the usual process that the other projects had to undergo during the budget call.

asr-001832
02:36:12.800 --> 02:36:17.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, in that case po, it's an additional safeguard on the part of DBM

asr-001833
02:36:17.360 --> 02:36:19.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to be able to make sure that these projects,

asr-001834
02:36:19.780 --> 02:36:23.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: comply with the same requirements as the projects in the NEP.

asr-001835
02:36:23.360 --> 02:36:27.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, meron pong ganong additional safeguard, kaya po naging FISARO po.

asr-001836
02:36:28.000 --> 02:36:31.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ano po yung legal basis para gawin yun?

asr-001837
02:36:34.080 --> 02:36:45.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Every congressional initiative or amendment was done, dumaan po yan sa RDC and was properly vetted.

asr-001839
02:36:52.620 --> 02:36:55.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I wanted to know what the legal basis was for the president to do a veto.

asr-001840
02:36:55.200 --> 02:36:56.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Are you saying, Madam Chair,

asr-001841
02:36:58.360 --> 02:37:00.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: distinguished colleague, na pag dumaan po sa atin,

asr-001842
02:37:01.240 --> 02:37:03.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: dumaan po sa congressional,

asr-001843
02:37:04.160 --> 02:37:06.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: sa House, dumaan sa Senate, hindi po natin binibeta?

asr-001844
02:37:07.160 --> 02:37:10.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The legal basis po for this, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague,

asr-001845
02:37:10.820 --> 02:37:15.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: is the veto power of the president as indicated in the veto message.

asr-001846
02:37:16.200 --> 02:37:19.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There's a particular section there in the veto message that

asr-001847
02:37:19.400 --> 02:37:23.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: that pertains to increases in appropriations and new budgetary items.

asr-001848
02:37:23.440 --> 02:37:32.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At doon po, linae out po yung mga conditions na kailangan po ma-meet for the release of these items

asr-001849
02:37:32.200 --> 02:37:37.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: that are either new budgetary items or saw increases in appropriations.

asr-001850
02:37:38.000 --> 02:37:44.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: In the 2026 GAA, ano yung veto message?

asr-001851
02:37:45.120 --> 02:37:47.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Saan po nakalagay na veto message yun?

asr-001852
02:37:47.160 --> 02:37:50.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Wala po sa veto message yun.

asr-001853
02:37:51.600 --> 02:37:57.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Doon po sa mismong veto message, it is under Section 6 with the header

asr-001854
02:37:57.560 --> 02:38:01.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Increases in Appropriations and New Budgetary Items as Published po.

asr-001855
02:38:02.300 --> 02:38:05.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: With the veto message as published in the official gazette.

asr-001856
02:38:05.780 --> 02:38:09.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Under what provision po nakalagay sa veto message?

asr-001857
02:38:09.820 --> 02:38:10.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Item 6 po.

asr-001858
02:38:11.020 --> 02:38:12.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What does it state specifically?

asr-001859
02:38:12.620 --> 02:38:17.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It pertains to increases in appropriations and new budgetary items.

asr-001860
02:38:17.160 --> 02:38:26.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I could read po the particular item if our distinguished colleague so desires.

asr-001861
02:38:27.020 --> 02:38:30.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: In the exercise of the budget execution function vested upon the executive branch,

asr-001862
02:38:31.240 --> 02:38:37.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: it is understood that the increases in appropriations and new budgetary items introduced by the Congress in this budget

asr-001863
02:38:37.240 --> 02:38:40.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: shall be subject to the national government's cash programming,

asr-001864
02:38:40.880 --> 02:38:43.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: observance of prudent fiscal management,

asr-001865
02:38:44.040 --> 02:38:46.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: applicable budget execution rules and procedures,

asr-001866
02:38:46.520 --> 02:38:47.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and,

asr-001867
02:38:47.160 --> 02:38:51.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and approval by the president based on the program priorities of the government.

asr-001868
02:38:51.600 --> 02:38:56.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Considering that such releases in appropriations and new budgetary items will have corresponding effects

asr-001869
02:38:56.480 --> 02:38:59.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: on the outputs and outcomes of the agencies concerned,

asr-001870
02:38:59.740 --> 02:39:03.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the DBM shall inform the said agencies of the changes in their respective appropriations

asr-001871
02:39:03.940 --> 02:39:06.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and require the submission of their revised performance target.

asr-001872
02:39:07.080 --> 02:39:11.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So nasa first paragraph po, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleagues, yung mga conditions.

asr-001873
02:39:13.020 --> 02:39:15.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that, Madam Chair, distinguished colleague.

asr-001874
02:39:16.620 --> 02:39:17.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair,

asr-001875
02:39:17.160 --> 02:39:23.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: may I apply natin kung ang isang project ay nasa FISARO at wala pang SARO,

asr-001876
02:39:23.680 --> 02:39:27.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: can public interest be invoked so that the SARO is never released?

asr-001877
02:39:28.320 --> 02:39:28.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes or no?

asr-001878
02:39:33.360 --> 02:39:38.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: My apologies, Madam Chair, Madam Speaker, medyo technical po kasi.

asr-001879
02:39:38.740 --> 02:39:43.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May I request for the question to be reiterated, releases po ba or suspension?

asr-001880
02:39:43.780 --> 02:39:46.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: No, I'll just...

asr-001881
02:39:47.160 --> 02:39:47.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I'll just repeat the question.

asr-001882
02:39:48.000 --> 02:39:48.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, please po.

asr-001883
02:39:48.760 --> 02:39:52.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kung ang isang project po ay nasa FISARO at wala pang SARO,

asr-001884
02:39:53.560 --> 02:39:57.320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: can public interest be invoked so that the SARO is never released?

asr-001903
02:40:14.200 --> 02:40:22.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, given that the question pertains to releases of items categorized under FISARO, opo, sa ilalim po nitong Section 6 ng veto message, maaari pong mangyari yan.

asr-001920
02:40:23.140 --> 02:40:23.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Opo.

asr-001921
02:40:24.540 --> 02:40:36.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sa ilalim po nitong section six ng veto message, maaari pong mangyari yan if several of the conditions, one of the conditions set forth are met.

asr-001922
02:40:36.620 --> 02:40:37.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Either...

asr-001923
02:40:37.940 --> 02:40:38.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Hindi...

asr-001924
02:40:38.980 --> 02:40:46.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It could either not meet the national government's cash programming or prudent fiscal management,

asr-001925
02:40:46.620 --> 02:40:51.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: or it went against applicable budget execution rules and procedures,

asr-001926
02:40:52.440 --> 02:41:02.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: if any of the conditions are not met, it is possible po that an item under PESARO will not be released under Section 6 of the veto message.

asr-001927
02:41:02.540 --> 02:41:12.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: How about, Madam Chair, distinguished colleagues, how about appropriations or line items introduced or amended by Congress?

asr-001928
02:41:12.000 --> 02:41:17.320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can the Executive likewise refuse the release by invoking public interest?

asr-001929
02:41:21.340 --> 02:41:39.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker. Given that whichever was included in either the HGAB or the SGAB or the BICAM that was not there in the NEPFOS under new budgetary items or increases in appropriations, the same section holds po. So it is possible.

asr-001930
02:41:39.580 --> 02:41:41.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, kung hindi po natin tatanggal,

asr-001931
02:41:42.000 --> 02:41:48.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: kung hindi po natin tatanggalin yung provision, which okay naman na sinasabi ng DBM, willing silang tanggalin yung provision on suspension.

asr-001932
02:41:51.320 --> 02:41:58.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: For 2026, bakit hindi po kasi, bakit hindi na lang veto ang nangyari?

asr-001933
02:41:59.180 --> 02:42:05.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi parang nakakatakot po eh. Kung pagkatapos ba in-act ang GAA, pwede nang piliin ng Executive.

asr-001934
02:42:05.680 --> 02:42:11.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Given this provision, pwede na pong piliin ng Executive kung alin ang ilalabas at alin ang hindi.

asr-001935
02:42:12.000 --> 02:42:22.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hindi simply ang hindi i-invoke at alin ang hindi simply by invoking public interest, hindi pa parang nire-rewrite na ng Executive ang GAA.

asr-001936
02:42:42.000 --> 02:43:06.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, ang nangyari po kasi kung dumedetsa po kaagad sa veto, given the volume of the line items of the budget that would be affected by the condition,

asr-001937
02:43:06.240 --> 02:43:11.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: which would be the increases in appropriations or the new budgetary items,

asr-001938
02:43:12.000 --> 02:43:22.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: maapektuhan po kasi yung essentially marami pong mga projects and programs and activities na madi-disallow kung dalesyo po tayo sa veto.

asr-001939
02:43:22.520 --> 02:43:27.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So ang ginawa nilang po as a safeguard, sinubject nilang po doon sa iba't ibang mga kondisyon.

asr-001940
02:43:28.140 --> 02:43:38.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So if straight to veto po kasi, ang mangyayari matatanggal po lahat sila so that would affect economic growth and government expenditure.

asr-001941
02:43:38.620 --> 02:43:41.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hindi po ba pwede, Madam Chair, na very...

asr-001942
02:43:42.000 --> 02:43:45.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Like you mentioned, very specific naman yung veto message.

asr-001943
02:43:46.180 --> 02:43:52.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: It can be very specific where kung ano yung ayaw ng Presidente na provision, yun lang ang i-veto niya.

asr-001944
02:43:59.820 --> 02:44:05.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And may I ask, bakit nyo po sinasabing maapektuhan ng economic growth?

asr-001945
02:44:05.480 --> 02:44:11.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi parang ang sinasabi nyo, effectively, by saying that this will affect economic growth,

asr-001946
02:44:12.000 --> 02:44:15.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: hindi ba nyo sinasabi na parang gagamitin natin ito as savings?

asr-001947
02:44:17.800 --> 02:44:23.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Mr. Speaker, actually po yun po yung ginawa ng Presidente.

asr-001948
02:44:23.260 --> 02:44:28.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Nag-line veto lang po siya ng particular items doon po sa 2026 budget.

asr-001949
02:44:29.480 --> 02:44:40.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But ito po is the veto message, the Section 6 of veto message specifically governs increases in appropriations and new budgetary items.

asr-001950
02:44:40.000 --> 02:44:41.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Based on your answer lang, Madam Chair.

asr-001951
02:44:42.000 --> 02:44:44.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you very much, Mr. Presidente.

asr-001952
02:44:44.000 --> 02:45:00.040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Distinguished colleague, parang ang sinasabi nyo kasi, the reason why we introduced this provision is for the purpose na magkaroon ng flexibility yung Presidente para kung sakaling gagamitin niya, i-invoke niya yung public interest.

asr-001953
02:45:00.000 --> 02:45:01.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: interest na

asr-001954
02:45:01.860 --> 02:45:03.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: provision, ay pwede pong

asr-001955
02:45:03.960 --> 02:45:06.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: gamitin yung pera

asr-001956
02:45:06.200 --> 02:45:07.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: at ilipat sa ibang

asr-001957
02:45:07.780 --> 02:45:09.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: mga proyekto.

asr-001958
02:45:15.480 --> 02:45:16.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May time, please.

asr-001959
02:45:18.460 --> 02:45:19.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pakitigil.

asr-001964
02:46:43.200 --> 02:46:59.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, actually po kahit wala po itong provision na 'to, kahit wala po itong general provision na 'to, the President has the power vested by the Constitution to use savings.

