Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Heads of Constitutional Commissions

asr-001976
02:47:21.340 --> 02:47:23.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: may, by law, be authorized

asr-001977
02:47:23.940 --> 02:47:25.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to augment any item in the General

asr-001978
02:47:25.840 --> 02:47:27.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Appropriations Law for their respective

asr-001979
02:47:27.840 --> 02:47:29.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: offices from savings in other

asr-001980
02:47:29.620 --> 02:47:31.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: items of their respective

asr-001981
02:47:31.240 --> 02:47:33.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: appropriations. So, mayroon din pong

asr-001982
02:47:33.380 --> 02:47:35.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: constitutional basis ito pong

asr-001983
02:47:35.620 --> 02:47:37.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: use of savings ng Pangulo.

asr-001984
02:47:39.240 --> 02:47:41.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sige. Madam Chair,

asr-001985
02:47:41.720 --> 02:47:43.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: kapag, I'll just go

asr-001986
02:47:43.080 --> 02:47:44.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: on to my next question, no?

asr-001987
02:47:45.360 --> 02:47:46.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Diyan rin naman tayo pupunta.

asr-001988
