Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It is not declared

asr-001998
02:48:17.780 --> 02:48:20.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as abandoned or

asr-001999
02:48:20.120 --> 02:48:22.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: hindi pa naman po siya technically na

asr-002000
