Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: maging savings dahil po

asr-002017
02:48:51.200 --> 02:48:53.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa Section 78. So, merely

asr-002018
02:48:53.320 --> 02:48:54.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: suspended lang po.

asr-002019
