asr-002056
02:50:18.800 --> 02:50:20.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And then, after that,

asr-002057
02:50:21.280 --> 02:50:23.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: projects that have

asr-002058
02:50:23.520 --> 02:50:24.140
