asr-002059
02:50:24.140 --> 02:50:27.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: released but have not been obligated

asr-002060
02:50:27.560 --> 02:50:29.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as a result of any

asr-002061
02:50:29.080 --> 02:50:30.840
