asr-002062
02:50:30.840 --> 02:50:33.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: can be declared as savings.

asr-002063
02:50:33.920 --> 02:50:35.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, first condition po,

