02:50:35.800 --> 02:50:37.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: it can completion,

asr-002065
02:50:37.820 --> 02:50:39.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: final discontinuance,

asr-002066
02:50:39.480 --> 02:50:41.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: or abandonment of a program,

asr-002067
02:50:41.240 --> 02:50:42.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: activity, or project for which

asr-002068
02:50:42.760 --> 02:50:43.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the appropriation is authorized.

asr-002069
02:50:44.600 --> 02:50:46.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Or, the second po would be

