02:50:48.200 --> 02:50:50.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in improved systems and efficiencies

asr-002072
02:50:50.480 --> 02:50:52.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and thus enabled an agency

asr-002073
02:50:52.080 --> 02:50:54.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to meet and deliver the required

asr-002074
02:50:54.280 --> 02:50:56.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: or planned targets, programs,

asr-002075
02:50:56.180 --> 02:50:57.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and services approved in this Act

