02:51:44.120 --> 02:51:46.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for something to be considered

asr-002095
02:51:46.340 --> 02:51:47.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: eventually as a saving.

asr-002096
02:51:48.360 --> 02:51:49.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, hindi po,

asr-002097
02:51:50.320 --> 02:51:52.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: pag suspended po, wala pong posibilidad

asr-002098
02:51:52.140 --> 02:51:53.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na ma-declare siya bilang savings.

asr-002099
02:51:57.460 --> 02:51:58.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kung ang project na ito,

asr-002100
02:51:58.540 --> 02:51:59.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: project po ay

asr-002101
02:51:59.260 --> 02:52:00.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: implementation ready naman

asr-002102
