Rep. Roberto Nazal: because of public interest

asr-002104
02:52:04.300 --> 02:52:04.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: so requires,

asr-002105
02:52:06.840 --> 02:52:07.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: hindi siya pwede maging,

asr-002106
02:52:07.860 --> 02:52:08.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: pwede ba siya maging savings?

asr-002107
02:52:14.120 --> 02:52:16.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For, if we're going back po

