02:52:16.540 --> 02:52:18.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to Section 78,

asr-002109
02:52:18.660 --> 02:52:19.500
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker,

asr-002110
02:52:19.860 --> 02:52:21.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: where public,

asr-002111
02:52:22.160 --> 02:52:23.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: when public interest

asr-002112
02:52:23.960 --> 02:52:25.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: so requires,

asr-002113
02:52:25.620 --> 02:52:27.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: was set forth as a condition,

asr-002114
02:52:27.900 --> 02:52:28.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: hindi po.

asr-002115
02:52:28.540 --> 02:52:31.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, dahil yung Section 78 po

asr-002116
02:52:31.100 --> 02:52:33.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay tumutukoy lang po

asr-002117
02:52:33.940 --> 02:52:34.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa suspension,

asr-002118
02:52:34.980 --> 02:52:36.500
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: hindi po sa release.

asr-002119
02:52:37.160 --> 02:52:38.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kaya hindi po,

asr-002120
02:52:38.580 --> 02:52:40.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: dahil po suspended, wala pong SARO,

asr-002121
02:52:41.400 --> 02:52:42.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kaya po later on,

asr-002122
02:52:42.660 --> 02:52:44.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: hindi rin po pwedeng i-declare as savings.

asr-002123
