Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair,

asr-002124
02:52:49.000 --> 02:52:50.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: hindi pwedeng suspended

asr-002125
02:52:50.300 --> 02:52:53.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: kapag tinanong natin kung bakit pinatigil.

asr-002126
02:52:53.680 --> 02:52:54.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pero abandoned

asr-002127
02:52:54.580 --> 02:52:56.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: naman kapag kailangan yung gumawa

asr-002128
02:52:56.680 --> 02:52:57.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ng savings.

asr-002129
02:52:57.200 --> 02:52:57.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So,

asr-002130
02:52:58.540 --> 02:53:01.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ano ba talaga?

