02:53:03.840 --> 02:53:04.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker,

asr-002133
02:53:04.840 --> 02:53:06.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: if I may draw the distinction.

asr-002134
02:53:06.920 --> 02:53:09.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, if a project is suspended,

asr-002135
02:53:09.760 --> 02:53:11.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the SARO was not released

asr-002136
02:53:11.200 --> 02:53:12.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in the first place.

asr-002137
02:53:12.100 --> 02:53:14.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, there is no ongoing project

asr-002138
02:53:14.020 --> 02:53:16.500
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to be declared as discontinued.

asr-002139
02:53:17.600 --> 02:53:19.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, magkaiba po yun.

asr-002140
02:53:19.700 --> 02:53:21.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: If I may draw the distinction,

asr-002141
02:53:21.760 --> 02:53:22.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker,

asr-002142
02:53:22.880 --> 02:53:24.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: if something is suspended,

asr-002143
02:53:25.260 --> 02:53:26.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: wala pong

asr-002144
02:53:26.340 --> 02:53:28.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: SARO na na-release,

asr-002145
02:53:28.540 --> 02:53:30.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: wala pong project na pwedeng i-declare

asr-002146
02:53:30.860 --> 02:53:32.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as discontinued.

asr-002147
02:53:32.520 --> 02:53:34.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, in effect po, wala din pong pwedeng

asr-002148
02:53:34.980 --> 02:53:36.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: project na

asr-002149
02:53:36.260 --> 02:53:39.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: pwedeng i-declare as savings.

asr-002150
02:53:39.300 --> 02:53:41.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, magkaiba po, just to draw the distinction po,

asr-002151
02:53:41.680 --> 02:53:42.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker.

asr-002152
02:53:42.540 --> 02:53:44.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But based on Arawlio, Madam Chair,

asr-002153
02:53:46.380 --> 02:53:47.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: distinguished colleague,

asr-002154
02:53:48.080 --> 02:53:49.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: bawal po i-suspend

asr-002155
02:53:49.560 --> 02:53:51.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ang project

asr-002156
02:53:51.860 --> 02:53:53.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ng walang SARO.

asr-002157
02:53:56.100 --> 02:53:57.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Very clear po yun.

asr-002158
02:53:58.540 --> 02:54:03.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, if I may po,

asr-002159
02:54:03.580 --> 02:54:05.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in the Arawlio

asr-002160
02:54:05.160 --> 02:54:06.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ruling po,

asr-002161
02:54:07.020 --> 02:54:09.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: it says na bawal pong

asr-002162
02:54:09.340 --> 02:54:11.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: i-declare

asr-002163
02:54:11.760 --> 02:54:13.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: my apologies, bawal pong

asr-002164
02:54:13.340 --> 02:54:15.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: i-declare as savings

asr-002165
02:54:15.460 --> 02:54:17.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: hanggang walang

asr-002166
02:54:17.360 --> 02:54:19.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: SARO release. Wala pong nare-release

asr-002167
02:54:19.620 --> 02:54:21.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na SARO. So, it's not actually

asr-002168
02:54:21.560 --> 02:54:25.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in terms of suspension,

asr-002169
02:54:25.520 --> 02:54:27.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: it actually talks about the prohibition

asr-002170
02:54:27.340 --> 02:54:28.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: of declaring

asr-002171
02:54:28.640 --> 02:54:31.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: savings for a project

asr-002172
02:54:31.640 --> 02:54:33.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: or a discontinued project for which

asr-002173
02:54:33.720 --> 02:54:35.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: a SARO has not been released.

asr-002174
02:54:38.080 --> 02:54:39.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: In Arawlio,

asr-002175
02:54:40.080 --> 02:54:41.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: if you will look at the

asr-002176
02:54:41.220 --> 02:54:49.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: It includes suspension po,

asr-002177
02:54:50.040 --> 02:54:50.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair.

asr-002178
02:54:53.120 --> 02:54:55.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, we'll just pull up

asr-002179
02:54:55.740 --> 02:54:56.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the

asr-002180
02:54:56.140 --> 02:54:58.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: actual document for Arawlio.

asr-002181
02:54:59.960 --> 02:55:01.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: If we may request po

asr-002182
02:55:01.420 --> 02:55:02.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for a few

asr-002183
02:55:02.400 --> 02:55:04.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: seconds.

asr-002186
02:55:34.240 --> 02:55:44.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, if we may request

asr-002187
02:55:44.620 --> 02:55:46.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for a moment

asr-002188
02:55:46.840 --> 02:55:48.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: of suspension po for us just to be able

asr-002189
02:55:48.760 --> 02:55:50.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to pull the exact wordings from the Arawlio

asr-002190
02:55:50.880 --> 02:55:52.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: jurisprudence.

asr-002191
02:55:52.000 --> 02:55:53.100
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Session suspended.

asr-002200
03:00:06.200 --> 03:00:11.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, we're ready po.

asr-002200-split-2
03:00:11.700 --> 03:00:13.900
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Session is resumed.

asr-002201
03:00:14.000 --> 03:00:16.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, if I may respond to our distinguished colleague.

asr-002202
03:00:16.300 --> 03:00:27.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So looking at the Araulio jurisprudence, it defines the terminology that would allow for the use of savings.

asr-002203
03:00:27.040 --> 03:00:45.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: If I may read out, just if you would allow me, Section 60, Section 54, and Section 53 of the General Provisions of the 2011, 2012, and 2013 GAAS, respectively, contemplate three sources of savings.

asr-002204
03:00:45.400 --> 03:00:48.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So dinidefine po yung tatlong sources ng savings.

asr-002205
03:00:49.280 --> 03:00:56.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: First, there can be savings when there are funds still available after completion of work, activity, or project,

asr-002206
03:00:56.080 --> 03:01:01.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: which means there are excess funds remaining after the work, activity, or project is completed.

asr-002207
03:01:02.200 --> 03:01:08.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There can also be savings when there is final discontinuance of the work, activity, or project,

asr-002208
03:01:08.960 --> 03:01:17.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: which means that there are funds remaining after work, activity, or project was started but finally discontinued before completion.

asr-002209
03:01:18.080 --> 03:01:24.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: To illustrate, a bridge halfway completed is destroyed by floods or earthquake and thus finally discontinued

asr-002210
03:01:24.320 --> 03:01:26.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: because the remaining funds are not sufficient.

asr-002211
03:01:26.080 --> 03:01:35.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Here, the funds are obligated but the remaining funds are deobligated upon final discontinuance of the project.

asr-002212
03:01:35.560 --> 03:01:43.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: On the other hand, abandonment means the work, activity, or project can no longer be started because of lack of time to obligate the funds,

asr-002213
03:01:44.220 --> 03:01:47.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: resulting in the physical impossibility to obligate the funds.

asr-002214
03:01:48.060 --> 03:01:55.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: This happens when a month or two before the end of the fiscal year, there is no more time to conduct a public bidding to obligate the funds.

asr-002218
03:01:55.200 --> 03:02:01.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The funds are not and can no longer be obligated and thus will constitute savings.

asr-002219
03:02:01.800 --> 03:02:05.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Dito po tayo sa last sentence mag-align.

asr-002220
03:02:05.960 --> 03:02:17.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, final discontinuance or abandonment excludes suspension or temporary stoppage of the work, activity, or the project.

asr-002221
03:02:17.600 --> 03:02:25.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Suspension, as it is referred to here in the Arroyo jurisprudence,

asr-002223
03:02:25.960 --> 03:02:31.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: is the whole phrase po, suspension or temporary stoppage of the work, activity, or project.

asr-002224
03:02:31.380 --> 03:02:41.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So it is not the same suspension that is talked about in Section 78 of the General Provision.

asr-002225
