asr-002226
03:02:45.000 --> 03:02:54.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What I was asking is, you replied earlier that the President has the power, can exercise the power to suspend

asr-002227
03:02:54.900 --> 03:02:55.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: even before the end of the fiscal year.

asr-002228
03:02:55.820 --> 03:02:55.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Even before the end of the fiscal year.

asr-002229
03:02:55.840 --> 03:02:57.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Even before allotment.

asr-002230
03:02:57.820 --> 03:03:08.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ang very clear po na sinasabi sa Arroyo is that the President cannot exercise the power to suspend or stop expenditure under Section 38

asr-002231
03:03:08.680 --> 03:03:15.040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: towards appropriations as funds for it have yet to be released and allotted.

asr-002232
03:03:16.660 --> 03:03:21.300
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: The Chair would like to remind Honorable Nazal, your time has expired.

asr-002233
03:03:21.640 --> 03:03:23.060
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Please wrap up your interpellation.

asr-002234
03:03:25.840 --> 03:03:27.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Maantay ko lang po yung sagot nila, Mr. Chair.

asr-002240
03:06:48.660 --> 03:06:55.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, we found the paragraph that Representative Nazal was referring to. If I may draw attention to a particular line which says Section 38 cannot be used by the President to stop permanently the expenditure of unobligated appropriated funds because that would amount to presidential power to impound funds appropriated in the GAA.

asr-002241
03:06:55.840 --> 03:07:25.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At yung nire-refer po ni Cong Robert is the next line: the President has no power to impound unobligated funds in the GAA. The operative word here po would be unobligated funds, and if something is categorized as unobligated, ibig sabihin po na-release na po iyon.

asr-002242
03:07:25.840 --> 03:07:55.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So it's different from something that has not been released. So ibig sabihin, the operative term here is that the President has no power to impound funds in the GAA that have been released but not yet obligated.

asr-002243
03:07:55.840 --> 03:08:25.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That's why in the succeeding sentences in the same paragraph the ruling reiterated the two reasons as also outlined in Section 84 on declaration of savings. So yun po, siguro po yung key doon: unobligated means it has already been released.

asr-002244
03:08:25.840 --> 03:08:28.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So kailangan may SARO na. Kailangan po may SARO na.

asr-002244-split-2
03:08:28.800 --> 03:08:34.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So only pag may SARO na, doon lang pwedeng i-invoke?

asr-002244-split-3
03:08:34.500 --> 03:08:42.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, yung use of savings po. The suspension applies to

asr-002244-split-4
03:08:42.000 --> 03:08:46.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: unreleased funds.

asr-002244-split-5
03:08:46.300 --> 03:08:55.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And for those that are obligated, sorry, released, yun na po yung naggo-govern yung use of savings.

asr-002245
03:08:55.840 --> 03:09:01.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So only those which are allotted, or may allotment, ang pwedeng i-suspend?

asr-002245-split-2
03:09:01.200 --> 03:09:15.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I-declare as savings po, not suspend. Ang pwede lang pong i-suspend ay yung hindi pa released, pero ang pwede lang pong i-declare as savings ay yung released na po, meaning may allotment na po.

asr-002245-split-3
03:09:15.000 --> 03:09:19.200
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: All right. Honorable Nazal, your time is up.

asr-002245-split-4
03:09:19.200 --> 03:09:25.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I just like to reiterate. Ang nakalagay po kasi sa Araulio

asr-002246
03:09:25.840 --> 03:09:40.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: the President cannot exercise the power to suspend or stop expenditure under Section 38 towards appropriations as funds for it have yet to be released and allotted.

asr-002246-split-2
03:09:40.640 --> 03:09:42.870
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Final from the Chair.

asr-002246-split-3
03:09:42.870 --> 03:09:55.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes po, to that point, the President cannot declare something as savings. Cannot suspend, because something has

asr-002247
03:09:55.840 --> 03:09:58.250
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung...

asr-002247-split-2
03:09:58.250 --> 03:10:04.160
