asr-002870
03:34:09.180 --> 03:34:11.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, siguro po,

asr-002871
03:34:11.180 --> 03:34:14.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung sa flood control po,

asr-002872
