03:34:22.180 --> 03:34:26.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: tinanong po kanina ng ating distinguished colleague,

asr-002876
03:34:26.180 --> 03:34:28.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: where the deficit went.

asr-002877
03:34:28.180 --> 03:34:31.180
