asr-004038
04:57:26.500 --> 04:57:33.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Alam na siguro ng distinguished sponsor, yung punto na gusto kong iparating.

asr-004039
04:57:35.000 --> 04:57:39.780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung magkaroon ng privatization, kahit lang

asr-004040
04:57:39.800 --> 04:57:43.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kung sa rehabilitasyon at control ang operasyon ng Agos,

asr-004041
04:57:45.600 --> 04:57:51.820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: siguro, hindi matindi yung issue sa Pulangi, nasa bukid nun yun.

asr-004042
04:57:52.500 --> 04:57:56.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero I don't know pagdating sa Agos, I don't know.

asr-004043
04:57:57.040 --> 04:57:58.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi magkaiba talaga.

asr-004044
04:57:58.100 --> 04:58:07.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, ang susunod ko pong katanungan, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor,

asr-004045
04:58:09.800 --> 04:58:14.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ito po punta sa ating 2027 budget.

asr-004046
04:58:17.800 --> 04:58:20.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Balikan ko po sandali yung 2026.

asr-004047
04:58:23.800 --> 04:58:31.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tinalakay na natin yung 2027, pero kaya po ba nating punduhan yung 2026 natin na budget?

asr-004048
04:58:32.300 --> 04:58:37.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung ga-an natin sa 2026, kaya po ba nating punduhan lahat yun?

asr-004049
04:58:39.800 --> 04:58:44.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, ang susunod ko pong katanungan, Mr. Speaker,

asr-004050
04:58:44.800 --> 04:58:49.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: What I'm asking distinguished sponsor, Mr. Speaker, is that

asr-004051
04:58:49.800 --> 04:58:57.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: before we discuss the current budget intended for 2027,

asr-004052
04:58:57.800 --> 04:59:07.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: has the government the fiscal capacity to fully fund our 2026 general appropriations act?

asr-004053
04:59:07.860 --> 04:59:09.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker,

asr-004055
04:59:09.280 --> 04:59:21.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: With us, our National Treasurer, sorry to quote our National Treasurer, but she gives the assurance that we will be able to fund our 2026 budget.

asr-004056
04:59:21.740 --> 04:59:29.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Okay, maganda naman pong ganoon pala, kaya naman pala natin.

asr-004057
04:59:29.160 --> 04:59:41.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, nakalimutan ko pa po yung isang nakapublish na yung Diliman property ng Napokor.

asr-004058
04:59:41.460 --> 04:59:58.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang hindi ko rin maintindihan dyan, bakit ibinta natin, nandyan yung Napokor, nandyan nakaopisina yung Transco, ang ginawa, pinalipat si Napokor, nagririnta na lang ng 3.5 million a month.

asr-004059
04:59:59.160 --> 04:59:59.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero mayroon naman.

asr-004060
05:00:00.000 --> 05:00:06.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: silang opisina. So siguro isama na rin pong tingnan yan ng mga economic

asr-004061
05:00:06.280 --> 05:00:13.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: managers natin. Although hindi po siya ganun kabigat doon sa pag-privatize

asr-004062
05:00:13.340 --> 05:00:17.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ng isang planta. Kasi yung planta talaga nag-degenerate ka agad ng income

asr-004063
05:00:17.640 --> 05:00:25.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yun. Tapos nag-contribute pa na mapababa yung cost of electricity natin.

asr-004064
05:00:25.620 --> 05:00:31.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero isama rin 'yan sa privatization kasi naalala ko kasama yung

asr-004065
05:00:31.240 --> 05:00:45.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: diliman property ng napokor. So for my next point, Mr. Speaker, since you

asr-004066
05:00:45.660 --> 05:00:55.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: categorically answer na kaya naman po nating punduhan yung 2026

asr-004067
05:00:55.240 --> 05:01:06.780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: budget natin or yung ga-a, in 2027, ito po ay people-centered.

asr-004068
05:01:07.900 --> 05:01:19.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sabi nga ni Secretary Kim ng DBM, ang meaning nito: Dapat ang Budget Makatao.

asr-004069
05:01:20.680 --> 05:01:24.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So tama naman po yun. I agree with him. So may we ask the

asr-004070
05:01:25.240 --> 05:01:32.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: good sponsor to explain what objective or criteria, no, such as the

asr-004071
05:01:32.760 --> 05:01:40.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Philippine Development Plan for 2023 to 2028, sectoral plans, no, that needs

asr-004072
05:01:40.680 --> 05:01:46.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: assessments, feasibility study, and measurable outcomes. We're used to

asr-004073
05:01:46.400 --> 05:01:53.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: classify projects and programs as priorities across economic, social, defense,

asr-004074
05:01:53.940 --> 05:01:55.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: general public service.

asr-004075
05:01:55.240 --> 05:02:23.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: We also need to consider the debt-burdened sectors. Natanong na po ito kanina. Medyo pasensya na po, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, medyo nakulangan ako doon sa sagot kasi I agree with Congressman Tinio na medyo may mga nilagyan tayo ng budget na

asr-004076
05:02:23.340 --> 05:02:49.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi naman totoong revenue generating yung contributor to economic growth na sana kung inuna natin yung ibang sektor na contributing to the economic growth, makikinabang din naman yung mga targeted subsidized sector.

asr-004077
05:02:49.680 --> 05:03:17.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, amid very limited fiscal space, increasing borrowing costs and growing debt levels, kinailangan pong mag-prioritize ng DBM sapagkat P[unclear] trillion po yung kabuuang budget proposals na dumating po sa kanila. So they had to prioritize P7.2 trillion out of that. The criteria that they used po, they employed five criteria:

asr-004078
05:03:17.820 --> 05:03:38.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: First is alignment with the Philippine Development Plan. Second is shovel readiness. Third is absorptive capacity. Fourth is fiscal space. And fifth po, prioritization of government programs that deliver the highest value and impact. So yun po yung limang kriteriya na ginamit po ng DBM.

asr-004079
05:03:39.780 --> 05:03:46.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Maraming salamat po, Distinguished Sponsor. Pupunta po ako doon sa absorptive capacity.

asr-004080
05:03:47.820 --> 05:04:03.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I totally agree na tama po yung kriteriya na yun. But I have a reservation, no? In reality, for example, may I cite the sitio electrification program of NEA.

asr-004081
05:04:03.680 --> 05:04:16.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Alam naman po natin yung economic contribution pag na-electrify natin yung isang lugar. Aside na nabigyan natin ng ginhawa yung mga tao.

asr-004082
05:04:17.820 --> 05:04:39.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Baka may mga negosyo. O hindi lang baka. In my experience, 43 years ako sa rural electrification, talagang umuunlad. Kaya nga yung mga barangay noon, nung nailawan na sa mga electric co-op yung area, nagiging munisipyo. Yung mga munisipyo nagiging city. Kaya malinaw po yung economic growth.

asr-004083
05:04:39.320 --> 05:04:47.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero pag-i-measure natin yung absorptive capacity ng NEA, dahil lang hindi nagastos yung...

asr-004084
05:04:47.820 --> 05:05:10.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayroon po tayong hindi nakita na dahilan. Nire-release po yung pundo, third quarter. Pag-release mo ng third quarter, sa bidding process pa lang, kakainin na niya yung buong third quarter.

asr-004085
05:05:10.500 --> 05:05:16.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pag-release ng DBM sa third quarter yan, mag-umpisa na yung project.

asr-004086
05:05:17.820 --> 05:05:30.020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Third quarter na, ay six months yung kailangan para ma-latag yung mga linya doon sa mga liblib na lugar. Ay talagang hindi niya ma-li-liquidate yun. Hindi ma-uubos.

asr-004087
05:05:30.020 --> 05:05:47.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya kung titignan yan, ay hindi maganda yung absorptive capacity. Ang sinasabi ko po, ay tingnan yung mga gray area na yan. Kung i-release yan ng first quarter, I agree na kung 70 lang siya, 60 or less.

asr-004088
05:05:47.820 --> 05:05:59.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: May problema siya sa absorptive capacity. Kasi we are talking here, doon sa example ko, of extending the lines to par-plunk and unviable areas na hindi po basta-basta.

asr-004089
05:05:59.660 --> 05:06:01.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you.

asr-004090
05:06:17.820 --> 05:06:30.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May malaki po tayong inilagay dyan sa Barsi noong 2026 budget po kasi nag-release po tayo ng, if I'm not mistaken, 2 billion sa sityo electrification program po within NEA.

asr-004091
05:06:30.880 --> 05:06:37.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, iti-check lang po ng pamilya natin sa DBM yung absorptive capacity utilization rate po ng NEA.

asr-004092
05:06:37.720 --> 05:06:47.220
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang tinutukoy ko lang, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, Distinguished Sponsor, ang ginawa ko lang example yung NEA.

asr-004093
05:06:47.820 --> 05:06:58.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: But I know, there are a lot of government agencies na hindi on time na-release yung kanilang budget appropriation.

asr-004094
05:06:58.580 --> 05:07:08.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, yung kriteriya natin na measurement na absorptive capacity, mayroon akong reservation.

asr-004095
05:07:09.440 --> 05:07:15.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi kung sasabi ko, third quarter muna i-release yan, tapos yung project nila, DICT halimbawa,

asr-004096
05:07:15.580 --> 05:07:27.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: e, bibiding pa nila yung mga kawan, yung mga supplier, yung mga contractor, ay hindi talaga nila ma-liquidate yan at the end of the fiscal year.

asr-004097
05:07:31.580 --> 05:07:35.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, magre-replic yan na mababa yung absorptive capacity nila.

asr-004098
05:07:36.700 --> 05:07:42.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, upon conferring with DBM, yes, they recognize that.

asr-004099
05:07:42.320 --> 05:07:45.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kasi po, halimbawa, second quarter na.

asr-004100
05:07:45.580 --> 05:07:56.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Or, paminsan third quarter na po nare-release yung SARO, talaga po natatamaan po yung utilization rate ng ahensya sa buong taon.

asr-004101
05:07:56.520 --> 05:08:05.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, they will look into it po and make sure that instead of doing, siguro, a straight line assessment,

asr-004102
05:08:05.660 --> 05:08:13.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: medyo baka pwedeng pro-rated yung approach para hindi naman po masaktan talaga yung utilization rate ng ahensya

asr-004103
05:08:13.140 --> 05:08:15.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: dahil late na-release yung SARO.

asr-004104
05:08:15.580 --> 05:08:17.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, DBM will look into it po.

asr-004105
05:08:17.960 --> 05:08:25.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I appreciate that. Sa lahat ng sekretary sa seven years ko dito, si Sekretary Kim lang ang umamin na titignan nila.

asr-004106
05:08:26.560 --> 05:08:32.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Lahat may mga ibang dahilan. So, thank you, Sekretary Kim, na titignan ninyo.

asr-004107
05:08:32.300 --> 05:08:41.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Lahat ng agency, ginawa ko lang example yung, ano, yung, actually, Mr. Speaker, may apat pa ako na issue.

asr-004108
05:08:41.640 --> 05:08:44.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero, papahingayin ko muna yung...

asr-004109
05:08:45.580 --> 05:08:51.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: favorite person ko. So, hindi ko na itatanong tong iba. Hindi ko na itatanong.

asr-004110
05:08:52.040 --> 05:08:58.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, thank you, Mr. Speaker. Thank you sa mga sagot, Sekretary Kim, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-004111
05:08:58.740 --> 05:09:04.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much po to our distinguished colleague, Kong Sergio Dagooc. Thank you very much po.

asr-004112
05:09:04.500 --> 05:09:07.100
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Thank you, the Honorable Dagooc. Majority Leader.

asr-004113
05:09:09.180 --> 05:09:12.100
Rep. Munir N. Arbison Jr.: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable...

asr-004114
05:09:12.100 --> 05:09:24.820
Rep. Crispin Diego D. Remulla: Honorable Elijah San Fernando from Partylist Kamanggagawa to interplay it on the proposed budget on the debate on general principles and provisions.

asr-004115
05:09:25.760 --> 05:09:32.120
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: The Honorable Elijah San Fernando of Partylist Kamanggagawa is recognized. Please proceed.

asr-004116
05:09:32.740 --> 05:09:38.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Speaker, at sa ating kagalang-galang na sponsor, Chairperson Mika.

asr-004117
05:09:39.720 --> 05:09:40.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang una kong katanungan...

asr-004118
05:09:42.100 --> 05:09:55.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Sponsor, Mr. Speaker, kinikilala po ng Estado ang fundamental na karapatan ng mga Pilipino sa impormasyon po yung People's Right to Information,

asr-004119
05:09:55.320 --> 05:09:58.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Article 3, Section 7 of 1987 Constitution.

asr-004120
05:09:59.740 --> 05:10:09.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And this simply means, Madam Sponsor, that transparency is paramount in all government proceedings, including the budget deliberations.

asr-004121
05:10:09.980 --> 05:10:11.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, Madam Sponsor, the...

asr-004122
05:10:12.100 --> 05:10:17.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The general provisions contain six separate transparency sections.

asr-004123
05:10:17.520 --> 05:10:38.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Can the sponsor point to a single provision in the HGAB or the 2027 NEP that gives an ordinary citizen or a duly accredited organization the right to be heard on record before an appropriation is finalized?

asr-004124
05:10:39.580 --> 05:10:40.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-004125
05:10:42.100 --> 05:10:55.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Sponsor, Madam Sponsor.

asr-004126
05:10:56.380 --> 05:11:08.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, there are two stages where there is involvement, not in the GAAP, but the first stage would be during the budget call.

asr-004127
05:11:08.740 --> 05:11:10.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So during the budget preparation stage...

asr-004128
05:11:12.100 --> 05:11:21.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yun noong budget calendar ng DBM na meron pong consultation sa atin pong mga civil society organizations

asr-004129
05:11:21.120 --> 05:11:24.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: or kung sino po yung gusto mag-participate in the budget process.

asr-004130
05:11:24.380 --> 05:11:40.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: In the budget process, on that part po, there is section 54 which pertains to Philippine Open Government Partnership.

asr-004131
05:11:40.180 --> 05:11:46.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, departments, bureaus, offices, and instrumentalities of the national government, etc.,

asr-004132
05:11:46.860 --> 05:11:53.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: shall adopt the open government partnership values of transparency, accountability, and citizen participation.

asr-004133
05:11:53.720 --> 05:11:57.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, doon po, nabanggit po yun, section 54.

asr-004134
05:11:57.760 --> 05:12:05.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We also have it not during the budget deliberations in Congress because that is a legislative function.

asr-004135
05:12:05.720 --> 05:12:10.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But while that's not in the GA itself or in the special...

asr-004136
05:12:10.160 --> 05:12:15.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: or general provisions, we've adopted that, we've institutionalized that.

asr-004137
05:12:16.040 --> 05:12:22.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Within the House po, we've formed the task force for people's participation, we've done the people's budget review,

asr-004138
05:12:22.980 --> 05:12:27.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we are refining the engagement models with civil society organizations.

asr-004139
05:12:28.120 --> 05:12:29.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, meron din pong ganong engagement.

asr-004140
05:12:30.480 --> 05:12:38.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And then, when it comes to implementation, after the GA is passed, marami pong special provisions na nakakalat po sa iba't-ibang ahensya

asr-004141
05:12:38.780 --> 05:12:39.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na nag...

asr-004142
05:12:40.160 --> 05:12:44.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: that allows people's audit for monitoring purposes.

asr-004143
05:12:44.780 --> 05:12:50.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I'm sure meron po under the special provision of the Department of Agriculture, for example,

asr-004144
05:12:51.460 --> 05:12:57.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: wherein a people's audit is allowed for infrastructure and for up-to-market road projects.

asr-004145
05:12:57.780 --> 05:13:01.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Madam Sponsor, Mrs. Speaker, for pointing that out.

asr-004146
05:13:01.420 --> 05:13:08.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Na merong konsultasyon na nagaganap sa agency level bago po umakyat o pumasok dito sa Kongreso.

asr-004147
05:13:09.020 --> 05:13:09.720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero the civil society...

asr-004148
05:13:10.160 --> 05:13:15.720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: the organizations would agree with me, and in fact, partner po natin, ang karamihan sa kanila,

asr-004149
05:13:16.320 --> 05:13:20.720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na kadalasan po, dito sa mga budget call ng mga ahensya ng gobyerno,

asr-004150
05:13:21.240 --> 05:13:25.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hindi naman po talaga napaka-meaningful ng participation ng mga civil society organizations.

asr-004151
05:13:26.720 --> 05:13:33.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: More often than not, nagiging stampad lang yung mga civil society organizations para lang masabi na merong participation.

asr-004152
05:13:33.340 --> 05:13:40.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At maganda po na na-point out ng ating sponsor yung Section 54, which I will proceed to that later, Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-004153
05:13:40.160 --> 05:13:51.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maganda po, Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, na binanggit ninyo na merong mga mekanismo tungkol sa transparency after the funds are already spent.

asr-004154
05:13:51.240 --> 05:14:04.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: In fact, if we are going to read together all the sections pertaining to transparency, lahat ito ay pumapatungkol kapag na-spent na o na-gasos na yung pondo.

asr-004155
05:14:04.320 --> 05:14:09.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So walang mga probisyon na pumapatungkol doon sa participation ng mga organizations.

asr-004156
05:14:10.160 --> 05:14:18.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Inari yung Pilipino o na mga people's organizations, civil society organizations, doon sa proseso ng pagbalangkas pa lang ng budget.

asr-004157
05:14:18.720 --> 05:14:20.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po ba ito, Madam Sponsor, Mr. Speaker?

asr-004158
05:14:23.360 --> 05:14:27.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, yes, we recognize that point.

asr-004159
05:14:27.860 --> 05:14:35.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: However, sa gaap po kasi, the special provisions there relate to budget implementation.

asr-004160
05:14:36.240 --> 05:14:39.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That's why there are no general or special provisions.

asr-004161
05:14:39.540 --> 05:14:45.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That pertain in the deliberation and the formulation of the budget itself.

asr-004162
05:14:46.640 --> 05:14:55.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, yun po, kung titinan po natin, lahat po ng mga general provisions at special provisions na nakapaloob sa budget ay patungkol po sa budget implementation.

asr-004163
05:14:55.620 --> 05:14:57.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Madam Sponsor, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004164
05:14:57.880 --> 05:14:59.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nabanggit po ng sponsor.

asr-004165
05:15:00.000 --> 05:15:01.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kanina, yung Section 54 ng

asr-004166
05:15:01.700 --> 05:15:03.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: General Provisions po natin.

asr-004167
05:15:04.440 --> 05:15:05.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And the government shall adopt

asr-004168
05:15:05.960 --> 05:15:07.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: the values of transparency,

asr-004169
05:15:09.160 --> 05:15:09.720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: accountability,

asr-004170
05:15:10.520 --> 05:15:11.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and citizens' participation.

asr-004171
05:15:12.100 --> 05:15:13.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Sponsor, Mr. Speaker,

asr-004172
05:15:13.980 --> 05:15:15.680
