asr-005357
06:09:05.220 --> 06:09:06.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: like the NAPI-OPD.

asr-005358
06:09:07.100 --> 06:09:08.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And for us, Madam Speaker,

asr-005359
06:09:08.420 --> 06:09:10.240
