asr-005361
06:09:12.140 --> 06:09:14.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Public funds must flow to public welfare,

asr-005362
06:09:14.420 --> 06:09:15.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: not to secrecy,

asr-005363
06:09:15.340 --> 06:09:17.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: see that breeds plunder and

asr-005364
06:09:17.020 --> 06:09:19.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: impunity. Madam Speaker, I will

asr-005365
