Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: North to South Railway, dapat natapos na pero hindi.

asr-005777
06:45:47.000 --> 06:45:52.940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Subway natin, tinanggalan natin yan ng, nilagay natin sa amprogram what was already there.

asr-005778
06:45:52.940 --> 06:45:55.760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And, ako, saan nilagay?

asr-005779
