Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Metro Manila Priority Bridges for 3.7 billion.

asr-005793
06:47:00.780 --> 06:47:03.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There's also, under the Network Development Program po,

asr-005794
06:47:03.780 --> 06:47:10.780
