asr-006272
07:29:59.200 --> 07:30:00.020
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kumulang

asr-006273
07:30:00.000 --> 07:30:05.380
Rep. JC M. Abalos: 5.06 billion para sa CBMS, para sa panibagong cycle.

asr-006274
07:30:05.960 --> 07:30:09.120
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Unang-una, pwede po ba ito kumpirmahin ng ating sponsor

asr-006275
07:30:09.120 --> 07:30:15.180
Rep. JC M. Abalos: na may halagang mahigit kumulang 5.06 billion para sa CBMS for year 2027?

asr-006276
07:30:16.140 --> 07:30:17.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-006277
07:30:17.360 --> 07:30:19.860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Madam Speaker, would the distinguished sponsor also confirm

asr-006278
07:30:19.860 --> 07:30:23.880
Rep. JC M. Abalos: that for year 2024 when the POPCEN CBMS was conducted,

asr-006279
07:30:24.500 --> 07:30:28.200
Rep. JC M. Abalos: meron rin ditong budget na nakaalan na humigit kumulang 5 billion piso din?

asr-006280
07:30:28.200 --> 07:30:58.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-006281
07:30:58.200 --> 07:31:01.180
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Ang 2027, 10 billion na agad to.

asr-006282
07:31:01.440 --> 07:31:02.820
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So nais ko po malaman, Madam Chair,

asr-006283
07:31:03.300 --> 07:31:05.660
Rep. JC M. Abalos: mula nung naisabatas ang CBMS,

asr-006284
07:31:05.920 --> 07:31:10.860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: magkano na po ang total appropriations na ininvest ng ating pamahalaan sa CBMS?

asr-006285
07:31:28.200 --> 07:31:32.740
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Madam Speaker, perhaps we could stop my time as we wait for the response from the sponsor.

asr-006286
07:31:38.240 --> 07:31:39.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-006287
07:31:39.640 --> 07:31:42.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And then from 2024...

asr-006348
07:32:52.500 --> 07:33:14.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, so from 2019 to 2023, given that we were only doing pilot programs for the CBMS, 500 million po yung inallocate natin for the CBMS.

asr-006349
07:33:14.120 --> 07:33:31.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And then for 2024, mayroon na pong 5 billion kasi full-fledged na po yung pag-implement because it was a census year. We conducted the census in 2024, so for 2025 and 2026, again 500 million annually.

asr-006350
07:33:31.080 --> 07:33:38.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And then for 2027, since we're also conducting the census for 2027, 5 billion din po ang i-allocate.

asr-006351
07:33:38.680 --> 07:33:43.140
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Maraming salamat po, distinguished sponsor. So, uulitin ko lang po, Madam Speaker.

asr-006352
07:33:43.740 --> 07:33:50.380
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kung sakaling papayagan po natin na bigyan muli ng mahigit 5 bilyong piso ang CBMS,

asr-006353
07:33:50.860 --> 07:34:00.680
Rep. JC M. Abalos: ang ibig sabihin ito, mula nung naisabatas ang CBMS, magkakaroon po tayo ng more than 10 billion pesos that will be allocated to the CBMS.

asr-006354
07:34:00.680 --> 07:34:05.020
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Just one thing I want to make clear here, Madam Speaker. Hindi po ako tutol sa CBMS.

asr-006355
07:34:05.140 --> 07:34:07.320
Rep. JC M. Abalos: As a matter of fact, I fully support it.

asr-006356
07:34:07.980 --> 07:34:15.380
Rep. JC M. Abalos: When the CBMS Act was enacted into law, I thought that this would be a time wherein this would usher a new era

asr-006357
07:34:15.380 --> 07:34:20.540
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kung saan meron po tayong data-driven at evidence-based governance.

asr-006358
07:34:21.120 --> 07:34:28.960
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kaya nga po mula naging membro ako ng Kongreso, taon-taon, parating ko po tinatanong kung ano yung mga nagiging accomplishment ng CBMS

asr-006359
07:34:28.960 --> 07:34:36.020
Rep. JC M. Abalos: dahil nagsisilbi po itong gabay, hindi lamang sa LGU, kung hindi, sa bawat ahensya po ng pamahalaan.

asr-006360
07:34:36.420 --> 07:34:46.600
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Ngayon, ngayong nalaman po natin ang potential investment natin sa CBMS, gusto ko po malaman, Madam Speaker, kung ano ang nakuha natin kapalit nito.

asr-006361
07:34:47.140 --> 07:34:55.940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Uulitin ko po, Madam Speaker, we've spent more than 5 billion pesos for the CBMS and we're looking to invest 5 billion pesos more.

asr-006362
07:34:55.940 --> 07:34:58.940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: It's very important for us to know kung ano ang kabalitan.

asr-006363
07:34:58.960 --> 07:35:02.220
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kung ano ang buoang investment na makukuha natin kapalit nito.

asr-006364
07:35:04.140 --> 07:35:12.280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Unang-una, Madam Speaker, importante ang CBMS dahil hindi nakuhulaan ng gobyerno kung saan ang kahirapan.

asr-006365
07:35:13.060 --> 07:35:16.260
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Hindi na kanyang-kanyang listahan ang bawat ahensya.

asr-006366
07:35:16.960 --> 07:35:24.860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Hindi na dapat may hiwalay na listahan ang DSWD, ang ibang departamento, at ibang listahan ng LGU na hindi nagtutugma.

asr-006367
07:35:24.860 --> 07:35:28.860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kaya po ipinasa ang CBMS Act para magkaroon tayo ng ehem.

asr-006368
07:35:28.960 --> 07:35:37.940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Updated, disaggregated, household level information na maaaring gamitin ng national government at local government

asr-006369
07:35:37.940 --> 07:35:46.060
Rep. JC M. Abalos: para malaman natin sino sa ating populasyon, sino sa pamayanan ang nangangailangan, nasaan sila, ano ang kailangan nila,

asr-006370
07:35:46.540 --> 07:35:50.940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: at saan dapat mapunta ang limitadong pondo ng gobyerno.

asr-006371
07:35:50.940 --> 07:35:58.040
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And after all these years, and after all these billions allocated, magandang malaman po natin, Madam Speaker,

asr-006372
07:35:58.220 --> 07:35:58.940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kung na-deliverance.

asr-006373
07:35:58.960 --> 07:36:01.280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Mag-deliver ba natin ang pangakong yun?

asr-006374
07:36:02.020 --> 07:36:07.400
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Madam Speaker, as I've said, taon-taon po natin sinusubaybayan ang CBMS.

asr-006375
07:36:07.560 --> 07:36:14.500
Rep. JC M. Abalos: As a matter of fact, during the deliberations for the 2025 budget, if my recollection is correct,

asr-006376
07:36:15.340 --> 07:36:26.340
Rep. JC M. Abalos: the PSA said, on the plenary, as we were deliberating its budget, noong 2025, 70% completed ang CBMS.

asr-006377
07:36:26.340 --> 07:36:30.520
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And during that time, they even provided us original targets.

asr-006378
07:36:30.620 --> 07:36:32.840
Rep. JC M. Abalos: This is all on the record, Madam Speaker.

asr-006379
07:36:33.340 --> 07:36:37.640
Rep. JC M. Abalos: They said, October or December 2024, tatapusin na nila.

asr-006380
07:36:38.160 --> 07:36:40.020
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Ngunit, hindi nasunod.

asr-006381
07:36:40.400 --> 07:36:45.420
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And then during the succeeding budget deliberations, last year, August last year,

asr-006382
07:36:45.940 --> 07:36:54.860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: sinabi po sa atin na completed na ang 2024 CBMS covering approximately 26.3 million households.

asr-006383
07:36:54.860 --> 07:36:55.860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Could the distinguished sponsor?

asr-006384
07:36:56.340 --> 07:36:57.520
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Could the distinguished sponsor confirm this?

asr-006385
07:37:00.700 --> 07:37:02.960
Rep. JC M. Abalos: This is all on the record, Madam Speaker.

asr-006386
07:37:03.260 --> 07:37:05.560
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Sinabi po sa atin ng PSA last year,

asr-006387
07:37:06.120 --> 07:37:11.320
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kumpleto na ang CBMS covering 26.3 million households.

asr-006388
07:37:13.860 --> 07:37:15.160
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-006389
07:37:15.700 --> 07:37:17.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Just to the first point,

asr-006390
07:37:17.680 --> 07:37:23.320
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: we are one with our distinguished colleague that it's actually one of the mandates of the DepDep.

asr-006391
07:37:24.460 --> 07:37:26.220
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's supposed to generate,

asr-006392
07:37:26.700 --> 07:37:32.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: impartial and evidence-based analysis and programs that pursue national development.

asr-006393
07:37:32.160 --> 07:37:36.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So that is precisely the reason why we establish a CBMS.

asr-006394
07:37:37.820 --> 07:37:41.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Just with regards to the accomplishments of the CBMS,

asr-006395
07:37:41.140 --> 07:37:43.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: this is from, according to the PSA,

asr-006396
07:37:44.620 --> 07:37:49.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: 26.9 million households were collected information from,

asr-006397
07:37:50.020 --> 07:37:54.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: yeah, from out of the 29.7 million total households.

asr-006398
07:37:54.280 --> 07:37:55.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So that's 91%.

asr-006399
07:37:56.340 --> 07:37:57.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: After that,

asr-006400
07:37:57.340 --> 07:38:02.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and 2.9 million households were then identified as poor.

asr-006401
07:38:03.340 --> 07:38:07.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Another 2.5 million households were identified as near poor.

asr-006402
07:38:07.340 --> 07:38:08.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So,

asr-006403
07:38:08.340 --> 07:38:09.340
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Madam Speaker,

asr-006404
07:38:09.340 --> 07:38:15.340
Rep. JC M. Abalos: could the distinguished sponsor confirm kung last year during the plenary budget deliberations,

asr-006405
07:38:16.340 --> 07:38:22.340
Rep. JC M. Abalos: the PSA mentioned here in the plenary that the CBMS was completed,

asr-006406
07:38:22.340 --> 07:38:24.340
Rep. JC M. Abalos: covering more than 26 million households.

asr-006407
07:38:24.340 --> 07:38:25.340
Rep. JC M. Abalos: This is all in the record.

asr-006408
07:38:25.340 --> 07:38:25.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And gusto ko lang ito.

asr-006409
07:38:25.780 --> 07:38:28.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And gusto ko lang po i-confirm ng distinguished sponsor na

asr-006410
07:38:28.780 --> 07:38:31.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: yun po ang naging representation ng PSA dito sa Kongreso.

asr-006411
07:38:31.780 --> 07:38:33.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kompleto na daw siya as of last year.

asr-006412
07:38:34.780 --> 07:38:35.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-006413
07:38:35.780 --> 07:38:40.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: We confirm that we did indeed say that the CBMS was complete.

asr-006414
07:38:40.780 --> 07:38:48.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: All data was transmitted to the DSWD for their evaluation on the conditionality.

asr-006415
07:38:48.780 --> 07:38:53.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Of course, for the assessments and so that they can be guided in terms of

asr-006416
07:38:53.780 --> 07:38:54.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: what programs to evaluate.

asr-006417
07:38:54.780 --> 07:38:56.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: What programs to institute.

asr-006418
07:38:56.780 --> 07:38:58.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: With that being said,

asr-006419
07:38:58.780 --> 07:39:03.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the data that was collected because the CBMS was completed

asr-006420
07:39:03.780 --> 07:39:06.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: was used for the following DSWD programs,

asr-006421
07:39:06.780 --> 07:39:08.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the four-piece program,

asr-006422
07:39:08.780 --> 07:39:10.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the walang gutom program,

asr-006423
07:39:10.780 --> 07:39:12.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the social pension,

asr-006424
07:39:12.780 --> 07:39:16.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and the uplift beneficiaries which we ruled out because of the fuel crisis.

asr-006425
07:39:16.780 --> 07:39:18.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: That's only for 2026.

asr-006426
07:39:18.780 --> 07:39:19.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Madam Speaker,

asr-006427
07:39:19.780 --> 07:39:21.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: and if I also remember correctly,

asr-006428
07:39:21.780 --> 07:39:23.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: binanggit rin po ng PSA sa atin dito,

asr-006429
07:39:23.780 --> 07:39:24.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: last year,

asr-006430
07:39:24.780 --> 07:39:27.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: hindi lamang DSWD ang nag-request ng datos na ito.

asr-006431
07:39:27.780 --> 07:39:30.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: At sinabi po ito ng budget sponsor last year.

asr-006432
07:39:30.780 --> 07:39:32.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Sinabi nila na noong,

asr-006433
07:39:32.780 --> 07:39:34.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: for year 2026,

asr-006434
07:39:34.780 --> 07:39:36.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: may mga ahensya po,

asr-006435
07:39:36.780 --> 07:39:37.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: hindi lamang DSWD,

asr-006436
07:39:37.780 --> 07:39:39.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kundi kasama dito ang DA, DOE,

asr-006437
07:39:39.780 --> 07:39:40.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: TESDA,

asr-006438
07:39:40.780 --> 07:39:41.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: NCSC,

asr-006439
07:39:41.780 --> 07:39:42.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: DepEd,

asr-006440
07:39:42.780 --> 07:39:43.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: DOLE,

asr-006441
07:39:43.780 --> 07:39:44.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: DOH,

asr-006442
07:39:44.780 --> 07:39:47.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kung saan naghihingi po sila ng datos.

asr-006443
07:39:47.780 --> 07:39:49.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So hindi lamang DSWD programs dito.

asr-006444
07:39:49.780 --> 07:39:50.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: As a matter of fact,

asr-006445
07:39:50.780 --> 07:39:52.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: the CBMS is the backbone

asr-006446
07:39:52.780 --> 07:39:54.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: of all our programs.

asr-006447
07:39:54.780 --> 07:39:56.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Ito po yung datos na mag-guide,

asr-006448
07:39:56.780 --> 07:39:58.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: hindi lamang sa ating mga policy makers,

asr-006449
07:39:58.780 --> 07:39:59.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kung hindi,

asr-006450
07:39:59.780 --> 07:40:01.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: pati sa implementers ng ating mga programs.

asr-006451
07:40:01.780 --> 07:40:03.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And could the distinguished sponsor confirm this?

asr-006452
07:40:03.780 --> 07:40:04.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Hindi lamang DSWD,

asr-006453
07:40:04.780 --> 07:40:07.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kundi lahat ng iba't ibang ahensya ng pamahalaan.

asr-006454
07:40:07.780 --> 07:40:09.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-006455
07:40:09.780 --> 07:40:10.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As a matter of fact,

asr-006456
07:40:10.780 --> 07:40:11.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: besides all of the

asr-006457
07:40:11.780 --> 07:40:14.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: agencies mentioned by our distinguished colleague,

asr-006458
07:40:14.780 --> 07:40:15.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: so that's DSWD,

asr-006459
07:40:15.780 --> 07:40:16.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: DA,

asr-006460
07:40:16.780 --> 07:40:17.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: DOE,

asr-006461
07:40:17.780 --> 07:40:18.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: PhilHealth,

asr-006462
07:40:18.780 --> 07:40:19.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: DOLE,

asr-006463
07:40:19.780 --> 07:40:21.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the National Commission on Senior Citizens,

asr-006464
07:40:21.780 --> 07:40:23.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: so this is for the social attention,

asr-006465
07:40:23.780 --> 07:40:24.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the DepEd,

asr-006466
07:40:24.780 --> 07:40:25.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the TESDA,

asr-006467
07:40:25.780 --> 07:40:26.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the DOH,

asr-006468
07:40:26.780 --> 07:40:28.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and the National Council on Disability Affairs.

asr-006469
07:40:28.780 --> 07:40:29.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-006470
07:40:29.780 --> 07:40:31.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: gusto ko po malaman,

asr-006471
07:40:31.780 --> 07:40:34.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: ano ba ang definition ng Philippine Statistics Authority

asr-006472
07:40:34.780 --> 07:40:37.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kung sinabi nila na completed na ang CBMS?

asr-006473
07:40:37.780 --> 07:40:38.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kasi last year sinabi nila,

asr-006474
07:40:38.780 --> 07:40:39.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: completed na,

asr-006475
07:40:39.780 --> 07:40:42.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: covering 26.3 million households.

asr-006476
07:40:42.780 --> 07:40:44.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Let me remind everyone once again,

asr-006477
07:40:44.780 --> 07:40:47.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: limang bilyong piso ang ginastos natin dito.

asr-006478
07:40:47.780 --> 07:40:50.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And it's not just about the collection of data eh.

asr-006479
07:40:50.780 --> 07:40:53.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Ang makalaga dito kung paano ginagamit ang datos na ito,

asr-006480
07:40:53.780 --> 07:40:58.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: lalong-lalo na na pinaplano natin ang budget ng buong pamahalaan.

asr-006481
07:40:58.780 --> 07:41:00.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-006482
07:41:00.780 --> 07:41:03.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the definition of the completion of the CBMS is that

asr-006483
07:41:03.780 --> 07:41:05.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: all data has been gathered,

asr-006484
07:41:05.780 --> 07:41:08.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: all data has been transmitted to the respective agencies

asr-006485
07:41:08.780 --> 07:41:10.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and also to all of the LGUs.

asr-006486
07:41:10.780 --> 07:41:11.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, Madam Speaker,

asr-006487
07:41:11.780 --> 07:41:13.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: just to clarify ah,

asr-006488
07:41:13.780 --> 07:41:16.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: when the PSA says that the CBMS was completed,

asr-006489
07:41:16.780 --> 07:41:18.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kasama dito yung enumeration,

asr-006490
07:41:18.780 --> 07:41:19.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: data collection,

asr-006491
07:41:19.780 --> 07:41:21.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: processing,

asr-006492
07:41:21.780 --> 07:41:22.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: validation,

asr-006493
07:41:22.780 --> 07:41:23.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: turnover,

asr-006494
07:41:23.780 --> 07:41:25.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: at dahil nagagamit na talaga siya

asr-006495
07:41:25.780 --> 07:41:26.780
Rep. JC M. Abalos: ng mga ahensya ng pamahalaan,

asr-006496
