asr-008213
09:18:52.600 --> 09:18:54.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That's not the intention.

asr-008214
09:18:54.660 --> 09:18:56.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: But it was the result, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-008215
09:18:57.520 --> 09:19:08.640
