asr-008221
09:19:45.880 --> 09:19:53.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The question is, is NWPC deliberately hiding the said meeting?

asr-008222
09:19:53.900 --> 09:19:56.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The question is, is NWPC deliberately hiding the said meeting?

asr-008223
09:19:57.520 --> 09:20:06.100
