Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: It provides, and I quote,

asr-008240
09:21:30.100 --> 09:21:38.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Should the Board find urgent and reasonable grounds to commence the Minimum Wage Determination process

asr-008241
09:21:38.760 --> 09:21:43.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: earlier than 60 days prior to the anniversary date of the current wage order,

asr-008242
09:21:44.600 --> 09:21:51.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: it shall submit a written recommendation and justification for this purpose to the Commission

asr-008243
09:21:51.140 --> 09:21:55.340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: for the latter's consideration and approval within five working days.

asr-008244
09:21:55.400 --> 09:22:02.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Once approved by the Commission, the Board may initiate the Minimum Wage Determination process.

asr-008245
09:22:04.080 --> 09:22:04.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: End of quote.

asr-008246
