Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Question.

asr-008247
09:22:07.520 --> 09:22:13.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nagkaroon po ba ng sapat na justification para maglabas ng panibagong wage order?

