09:22:25.400 --> 09:22:28.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: May panibago ng wage order.

asr-008251
09:22:29.020 --> 09:22:30.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yung wage order No. 28.

asr-008252
09:22:31.080 --> 09:22:35.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: What was the justification of the Commission and the Regional Wage Board?

asr-008253
